### Day 2 smoke tests (VS Code REST Client / BAS). Start the app with: cds watch
@host = http://localhost:4004/leave
@annual = 30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@unpaid = 30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003

############ EMPLOYEE: priya.nair@company.com ############

### Who am I?
GET {{host}}/me()
Authorization: Basic priya.nair@company.com pass

### My requests (only her own)
GET {{host}}/MyRequests?$orderby=startDate
Authorization: Basic priya.nair@company.com pass

### My balances (daysRemaining is calculated)
GET {{host}}/Balances?$expand=leaveType($select=name)
Authorization: Basic priya.nair@company.com pass

### OK - 3 working days (Dec 7-9)
POST {{host}}/MyRequests
Authorization: Basic priya.nair@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leaveType_ID": "{{annual}}", "startDate": "2026-12-07", "endDate": "2026-12-09", "comment": "Family event" }

### FAIL - end before start (400)
POST {{host}}/MyRequests
Authorization: Basic priya.nair@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leaveType_ID": "{{annual}}", "startDate": "2026-12-10", "endDate": "2026-12-08" }

### FAIL - weekend only (400)
POST {{host}}/MyRequests
Authorization: Basic priya.nair@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leaveType_ID": "{{annual}}", "startDate": "2026-12-12", "endDate": "2026-12-13" }

### FAIL - not enough leave left (400)
POST {{host}}/MyRequests
Authorization: Basic priya.nair@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leaveType_ID": "{{annual}}", "startDate": "2026-12-15", "endDate": "2026-12-31" }

### FAIL - overlaps her pending request of Nov 16-19 (409)
POST {{host}}/MyRequests
Authorization: Basic priya.nair@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leaveType_ID": "{{annual}}", "startDate": "2026-11-17", "endDate": "2026-11-18" }

### OK - unpaid has no balance check
POST {{host}}/MyRequests
Authorization: Basic priya.nair@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{ "leaveType_ID": "{{unpaid}}", "startDate": "2027-01-04", "endDate": "2027-01-29" }

### FAIL - employee cannot change a request (403)
PATCH {{host}}/MyRequests(50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000022)
Authorization: Basic priya.nair@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{ "comment": "edited" }

### FAIL - employee cannot see the manager entity (403)
GET {{host}}/TeamRequests
Authorization: Basic priya.nair@company.com pass

############ MANAGER: arjun.rao@company.com ############

### Pending requests of his team (Priya, Rohan, Ananya)
GET {{host}}/TeamRequests?$filter=status eq 'PENDING'&$expand=employee($select=fullName),leaveType($select=name)
Authorization: Basic arjun.rao@company.com pass

### FAIL - reject without a reason (400)
POST {{host}}/TeamRequests(50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000022)/LeaveService.rejectRequest
Authorization: Basic arjun.rao@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Approve Priya's Nov 16-19 request
POST {{host}}/TeamRequests(50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000022)/LeaveService.approveRequest
Authorization: Basic arjun.rao@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### FAIL - decide the same request again (409, immutable)
POST {{host}}/TeamRequests(50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000022)/LeaveService.approveRequest
Authorization: Basic arjun.rao@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Reject Rohan's Dec request with a reason
POST {{host}}/TeamRequests(50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000026)/LeaveService.rejectRequest
Authorization: Basic arjun.rao@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Release freeze in December, please pick another week" }

### FAIL - a manager of another department (403)
POST {{host}}/TeamRequests(50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016)/LeaveService.approveRequest
Authorization: Basic vikram.singh@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{}

############ HR: meera.iyer@company.com ############

### HR sees every balance
GET {{host}}/Balances?$count=true&$top=5
Authorization: Basic meera.iyer@company.com pass

### Meera is the manager of the department heads: approve Arjun's December leave
POST {{host}}/TeamRequests(50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000031)/LeaveService.approveRequest
Authorization: Basic meera.iyer@company.com pass
Content-Type: application/json

{}
